sequenceDiagram
    participant Op as Operator
    participant Helm
    participant K8s as Kubernetes
    participant Pods as Wazuh pods
    Op->>Helm: Supply values and dependencies
    Helm->>Helm: Render manifests
    Helm->>K8s: Install resources
    K8s->>K8s: Provision volumes
    K8s->>K8s: cert-manager issues TLS Secrets
    K8s->>Pods: Schedule and mount resources
    Pods->>Pods: Initialize configuration and state
    Pods->>Pods: Start services
    Helm->>K8s: Create security hook Job
    K8s->>Pods: Job applies indexer security
    Op->>Pods: Verify APIs and indexed alerts
